\subsection{Definitions and mathematical statement}
\paragraph{Shared notation.}Standard number systems are $\mathbb N,\mathbb Z,\mathbb Q,\mathbb R,\mathbb C$. Specialized notation and index ranges follow the cited source and the definitions below.


A network connectivity matrix records which pairs of neurons are linked, optionally with strengths or directions. Reconstruction estimates this latent matrix from observed activity; identifiability requires different matrices to have distinguishable observation laws.
